1.install libudev-dev

sudo apt-get install libudev1
sudo apt-get install libudev-dev

2.install sdk

tar -xzvf TUCamSample_v1.0.xx.0_ubuntu22.04.tar.gz
chmod 777 ./sdk/lib/install.sh
sudo ./sdk/lib/install.sh

3.use demo

TUCamSample compile by Qt
define macro TUCAM_TARGETOS_IS_LINUX

4.the files build on Ununtu 22.04, if you have different system, please rebuild the SamplePro code

chmod 777 ./TUCamSample.sh
sudo ./TUCamSample.sh

5.the api same as on windows os
